Master Implementation Prompt — WörterBuch German Vocabulary Learning App

1. Role and Overall Objective

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, UI/UX designer, and German-language learning application specialist.

Inspect the existing WörterBuch application and implement all requirements in this prompt directly in the current project. This is an enhancement of an existing application, not a request to build a separate application from scratch.

Before changing anything:

* Inspect the current source code, components, data models, settings, event handlers, and application architecture.
* Identify the causes of existing bugs rather than applying superficial workarounds.
* Reuse existing components and data structures wherever practical.
* Preserve existing vocabulary, translations, examples, learning progress, review history, categories, and user settings unless a requirement explicitly calls for modifying or deleting them.
* Avoid regressions in existing functionality.
* Do not replace working features with mockups, placeholder buttons, or simulated behavior.

Implement the requirements below as a coherent, fully functional application. Do not stop after describing the proposed changes. Make the actual code changes, connect the relevant controls to real application behavior, and verify the results.

